OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifters using harpoon guns and
OL,4,Amachetes in targeted attacks, say shop
OL,5,Astaff
OL,6,
OL,7,FShop workers say they are facing rising
OL,8,Flevels of violence, including attacks
OL,9,Fwith harpoon guns and machetes, as
OL,10,Freports of shoplifting rise
OL,11,Fdramatically.
OL,13,FRetailers have warned of criminal gangs
OL,14,Fclearing whole shelves of products
OL,15,Fusing sacks, backpacks and even wheelie
OL,16,Fbins.
OL,18,FThey say the gangs are "stealing to
OL,19,Forder", targeting high-value products
OL,20,Fthat can be resold - such as energy
OL,21,Fdrinks and baby powder.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
