OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifters using harpoon guns and
OL,4,Amachetes in targeted attacks, say shop
OL,5,Astaff
OL,6,
OL,7,FReported shoplifting incidents have
OL,8,Frisen from 24,877 in 2021-2022 to
OL,9,F56,920 in 2025-2026. It represents a
OL,10,F129% increase in four years, according
OL,11,Fto Scottish government figures.
